    "scenesThatPass": [
      "FRANCES: Why, Mary --\nMARY: Hello, Frances.\nFRANCES: How's Miss Jacqueline?\nMARY: I don't know. That's why I came to see Mrs. Redi. I'm trying to find her.",
      "GLADYS: Gibson? Are you Jacqueline's sister?\nMARY: Yes. Do you --\nGLADYS: Know her! My dear, we were intimate! The times we used to have together! I bet she never told you about that -- you're too young.",
      "FRANCES: I can't see much fun in teaching school. Why don't you go into the beauty business.\nMARY: But I like teaching school.\nFRANCES: Well, if it's fun for you, it's all right. I get a kick out of my work when the customers aren't too crabby.\nMARY: Is Mrs. Redi nice to work for?",
      "MRS. CORTEZ: Cream or lemon, Frances?\nFRANCES: Lemon.\nMRS. CORTEZ: Miss Rowan, do you take cream?",
      "FRANCES: You can't do anything to her-- you mustn't hurt her!\nMRS. CORTEZ: But she betrayed us, Frances.\nFRANCES: She never betrayed us. She was only going to a doctor -- a psychiatrist."
    ]
  },
